# Step 11 — Configure Maven in Jenkins

Open Jenkins:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

Go to:

```text
Manage Jenkins
        ↓
Tools
```

Find the **Maven installations** section.

Add Maven.

Give it a name such as:

```text
